18:T8f3,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/work/gore-street-capital/","url":"https://kota.co.uk/work/gore-street-capital/","name":"Gore Street Capital - KOTA","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/work/gore-street-capital/#primaryimage"},"image":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/work/gore-street-capital/#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2025/10/Large-Logo.jpg","datePublished":"2025-10-20T13:28:01+00:00","dateModified":"2025-11-06T10:08:44+00:00","breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/work/gore-street-capital/#breadcrumb"},"inLanguage":"en-US","potentialAction":[{"@type":"ReadAction","target":["https://kota.co.uk/work/gore-street-capital/"]}]},{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/work/gore-street-capital/#primaryimage","url":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2025/10/Large-Logo.jpg","contentUrl":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2025/10/Large-Logo.jpg","width":2454,"height":1380},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/work/gore-street-capital/#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://kota.co.uk/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Gore Street Capital"}]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#website","url":"https://kota.co.uk/","name":"KOTA","description":"","publisher":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#organization"},"potentialAction":[{"@type":"SearchAction","target":{"@type":"EntryPoint","urlTemplate":"https://kota.co.uk/?s={search_term_string}"},"query-input":{"@type":"PropertyValueSpecification","valueRequired":true,"valueName":"search_term_string"}}],"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#organization","name":"KOTA","alternateName":"KOTA creative","url":"https://kota.co.uk/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#/schema/logo/image/","url":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2024/11/Logo-Profile.png","contentUrl":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2024/11/Logo-Profile.png","width":1080,"height":1080,"caption":"KOTA"},"image":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#/schema/logo/image/"},"sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/kotacreative/","https://x.com/kotacreative"]}]}22:T47b,<h2>Our approach</h2>
<p>We set out to create a brand and platform that matched GSC’s ambition. One that felt credible, confident, and unmistakably sustainable.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Stakeholder insight</strong> – We started with deep discovery: questionnaires and a workshop that uncovered running themes, USPs, and future needs. These became the building blocks of the new identity.</li>
<li><strong>An elegant brand ecosystem</strong> – A refined identity that’s authoritative yet accessible, ready to roll out seamlessly across a multi-fund strategy.</li>
<li><strong>Sustainability at the core</strong> – From colour to typography, every design choice reinforced their ethos and underlined their role in building a low-carbon future.</li>
<li><strong>A transformed website</strong> – Interactive maps to showcase international assets. Educational content to demystify energy storage. A cleaner hierarchy designed around investors. And a scalable platform with GSC as the hub and the Gore Street Energy Storage Fund as a connected, transparent sub-platform.</li>
</ul>
<p><!-- notionvc: 189ba9cb-00f8-4bc1-9212-de7c42a604b8 --></p>
