null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Branding</h2>\n<p>We built a cohesive system that reflects GSC’s confidence, expertise, and sustainable ethos.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Flexible brand architecture to support multi-fund growth</li>\n<li>A visual identity that balances authority with accessibility</li>\n<li>An ethos-led positioning rooted in “sustainability is part of our DNA”</li>\n<li>Consistent application of colour, typography, and imagery across every touchpoint</li>\n<li>Clear, jargon-free storytelling that makes energy transition investment engaging and compelling.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><!-- notionvc: 8ac4305b-ed48-4e04-a02c-8abc6fe5f412 --></p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_mediaGallery__vB7wJ ","data-margin":"default","style":{"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"children":["$","$L1f",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_grid___30fo MediaGallery_layout6__wJx6J","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_media1__9Ryxs","data-animation":"grid-item","children":[false,["$","$L20",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/10/Light_-Dark-mode.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_media2__Uc1vY","data-animation":"grid-item","children":[["$","$L1c",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/10/Desktop-2a.jpg 1188w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/10/Desktop-2a-431x500.jpg 431w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/10/Desktop-2a-768x891.jpg 768w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/10/Desktop-2a.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":1188,"height":1378}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],false]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_media3__rEmNG","data-animation":"grid-item","children":[["$","$L1c",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/10/Desktop-2b.jpg 1188w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/10/Desktop-2b-431x500.jpg 431w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/10/Desktop-2b-768x891.jpg 768w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/10/Desktop-2b.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":1188,"height":1378}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],false]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_media4__biNHW","data-animation":"grid-item","children":[false,["$","$L20",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/10/Map-UI-1.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}]]}],false]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy","data-margin":"default","data-right-empty":"true","style":{"--brand-color":"red"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Web design</h2>\n<p>We crafted a digital identity that feels bold, clear, and trustworthy.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A striking colour palette mixing high-energy orange and green with calm off-whites</li>\n<li>Treated imagery, flowing forms, and rounded edges inspired by the logo’s fluidity</li>\n<li>Confident typography treatments for impact and clarity</li>\n<li>Electrical orange highlights that draw the eye where it matters most</li>\n<li>An interactive map that transforms complex investment data into an accessible story.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><!-- notionvc: 32fdf88c-df70-49fd-925f-70d65a032a4d --></p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"$undefined","data-margin":"default","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"SingleImage_containedImage__N2jLD","children":["$","$L23",null,{"data":{"__typename":"Project_Singleproject_ContentBuilder_SingleVideo","fieldGroupName":"Project_Singleproject_ContentBuilder_SingleVideo","alignment":"contained","marginBottom":"default","loop":{"mediaItemUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/10/Large-Mobile.mp4"},"fullVideo":null}}]}]}],false]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy","data-margin":"default","data-right-empty":"true","style":{"--brand-color":"red"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>The result</h2>\n<p>The new brand and website put sustainability and credibility front and centre.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A bold, future-facing identity that reflects their global scale</li>\n<li>An online presence that builds trust with investors, partners, and stakeholders</li>\n<li>Clear storytelling that highlights their expertise, impact, and ESG commitments</li>\n<li>A scalable, future-ready platform designed to grow alongside their funds.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Now, when investors, partners, or potential employees arrive at Gore Street Capital, they see what the market already knows: a confident, trusted, and visionary leader in sustainable investment.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: 886417f7-c08d-4ec3-a9dc-3e160cb39f4f --></p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"RelatedPosts_relatedPosts__xfLkb","children":[["$","$L10",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"RelatedPosts_headingOuter__r3TEg","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"RelatedPosts_heading__3kOeH","children":["$","$L24",null,{"children":"Related Articles"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"RelatedPosts_viewAllLinkDesktop__db363","children":["$","$L24",null,{"delay":0.15,"children":["$","$L11",null,{"type":"a-internal","text":"View all articles","color":"white","href":"/blog"}]}]}]]}]}],["$","$L25",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","$L14","5850",{"className":"BlogP